"id": "1227794734288076805", "start": 85, "username": "FitzgeraldBio"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/jmaraganore/st…", "end": 290, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/jmaraganore/status/2116364866424619430", "start": 267, "url": "https://t.co/buC9ozMpVY"}]}, "id": "2117033401014526076", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116364866424619430", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Proud and excited to be partnering with Alnylam, working closely with @YGreenstreet, @FitzgeraldBio, Greg Hinkle, Joe Barry, Mark Schlegel and many more on accelerating and expanding their impressive platform with our frontier AI models for sequence-based medicines. https://t.co/buC9ozMpVY", "url": "https://x.com/kyosu/status/2117033401014526076"}, {"author_id": "43156539", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:17:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117031351673409731", "2117033353019044135", "2117033401014526076", "2117033577523400992"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 83, "id": "608319723", "start": 70, "username": "YGreenstreet"}, {"end": 99, "id": "1227794734288076805", "start": 85, "username": "FitzgeraldBio"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/jmaraganore/st…", "end": 289, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/jmaraganore/status/2116364866424619430", "start": 266, "url": "https://t.co/buC9ozMpVY"}]}, "id": "2117033353019044135", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116364866424619430", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Proud and excited to be partnering with Alnylam, working closely with @YGreenstreet, @FitzgeraldBio, Greg Hinkle, Joe Barry Mark Schlegel and many more on accelerating and expanding their impressive platform with our frontier AI models for sequence-based medicines. https://t.co/buC9ozMpVY", "url": "https://x.com/kyosu/status/2117033353019044135"}, {"author_id": "2038035734913757184", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:30:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117006456302035290"], "id": "2117006456302035290", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A new study checked the public safety docs of 6 frontier AI systems: none had enough structured evidence to verify 5 key safety claims — including AI identity disclosure and shutdown behavior. A safety check you can't audit is just a claim.", "url": "https://x.com/TheVitaHash/status/2117006456302035290"}, {"author_id": "147644299", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:38:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117008354891768078"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 234, "start": 231, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 244, "start": 235, "tag": "AIPolicy"}], "urls": [{"description": "AI companies will face a harsher Washington after Tuesday.", "display_url": "axios.com/2026/11/01/sco…", "end": 268, "expanded_url": "https://www.axios.com/2026/11/01/scoop-openai-post-midterm-policy", "images": [{"height": 768, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116889975673204736/1bmdQ49f?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1366}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116889975673204736/1bmdQ49f?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 245, "status": 200, "title": "Behind the Curtain: OpenAI's post-election power play", "unwound_url": "https://www.axios.com/2026/11/01/scoop-openai-post-midterm-policy", "url": "https://t.co/F9s6fDXcYV"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/O3cFpWq6Bl", "end": 292, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/joexuai/status/2117008354891768078/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117008344594657280", "start": 269, "url": "https://t.co/O3cFpWq6Bl"}]}, "id": "2117008354891768078", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "OpenAI hits Washington the day after the midterms.\n\n• Lame-duck blitz starts Nov. 9 (Axios)\n• Mandatory \"speed limits\" on frontier AI\n• Data centers rebranded \"AI compute campuses\"\n\nSoft noun. Hard lobby. Power bills don't rename. #AI #AIPolicy\nhttps://t.co/F9s6fDXcYV https://t.co/O3cFpWq6Bl", "url": "https://x.com/joexuai/status/2117008354891768078"}, {"author_id": "2115462984277413888", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:15:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117002524532072902"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Updated Nov 1, 2026 · read from the employers’ own boardsThe AI Jobs TrackerEvery open role on twenty AI, robotics and autonomy job boards, counted once a day. Not an aggregator, not an estimate — the employers’ own feeds, with the pay ranges they printed. Free to read, free to cite.3,831 open roles3,065 in the", "display_url": "profhlab.com/ai-jobs-tracke…", "end": 279, "expanded_url": "https://profhlab.com/ai-jobs-tracker/", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117002538784313344/k8QlXPXE?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117002538784313344/k8QlXPXE?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 256, "status": 200, "title": "AI Jobs Tracker - Prof H Lab", "unwound_url": "https://profhlab.com/ai-jobs-tracker/", "url": "https://t.co/caDQvCo2hJ"}]}, "id": "2117002524532072902", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Frontier AI is hiring. Just not for your first job.\n\n3,841 open roles across 20 AI and robotics companies (Oct 31). 3,075 in the US. Only 182 are entry-level US titles.\n\nTalent read for juniors: ship something public. In this market a demo beats a degree.\nhttps://t.co/caDQvCo2hJ", "url": "https://x.com/oneuphiring/status/2117002524532072902"}, {"author_id": "406594877", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:13:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117002191886331990"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 236, "id": "42979354", "start": 224, "username": "NYLawSchool"}, {"end": 252, "id": "3382165467", "start": 243, "username": "FABA_USA"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "nyls.wufoo.com/forms/q1hdztlm…", "end": 289, "expanded_url": "https://nyls.wufoo.com/forms/q1hdztlm0ph3u6g/", "start": 266, "unwound_url": "https://nyls.wufoo.com/forms/q1hdztlm0ph3u6g/", "url": "https://t.co/lqNQAlmuqy"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/G0UMNy2gWK", "end": 313, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/PierreCiric/status/2117002191886331990/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117002172931956737", "start": 290, "url": "https://t.co/G0UMNy2gWK"}]}, "id": "2117002191886331990", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 113, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "You are invited to a unique CLE program “FRONTIER AI &amp; CYBER RISK: COMPARATIVE LEGAL &amp; PRACTICAL CHALLENGES.” I will moderate on 11/05 (12:45pm-2:00pm) a great panel with Rubin Sfadj &amp; Matthew Lowe. Sponsored by @NYLawSchool &amp; @FABA_USA. Register at https://t.co/lqNQAlmuqy https://t.co/G0UMNy2gWK", "url": "https://x.com/PierreCiric/status/2117002191886331990"}, {"author_id": "1473283378384412679", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:45:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117010269725413878"], "id": "2117010269725413878", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚀 Generalist Expert – Remote AI Training Role\nHelp train frontier AI models with careful human judgment. Write prompts, grade outputs, and flag mistakes.\n\n💰 $40–$70/hr 📍 Fully remote | Part-time | Worldwide 🧠 No specific degree required — just strong reading &amp; reasoning", "url": "https://x.com/aspimenta/status/2117010269725413878"}, {"author_id": "2067346377513033728", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:06:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117000288443695124"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/4Ev6PWOR7q", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/CiVLDispatch/status/2117000288443695124/video/1", "media_key": "7_2116999517169950723", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/4Ev6PWOR7q"}]}, "id": "2117000288443695124", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 956, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "The artificial intelligence firm Anthropic has reportedly shared a draft of a bill to regulate frontier AI models with US lawmakers.\n\nThe draft proposal calls for the US government to have the ability to block the release of an AI model if it poses a “foreseeable, imminent” risk https://t.co/4Ev6PWOR7q", "url": "https://x.com/CiVLDispatch/status/2117000288443695124"}, {"author_id": "2235329532", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:00:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116998796185944464"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 67, "start": 60, "tag": "Circle"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/iEKpUlPliZ", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/johnmorganFL/status/2116998796185944464/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116998793610571776", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/iEKpUlPliZ"}]}, "id": "2116998796185944464", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 214, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Nine of ten frontier AI models raised the spending cap on a #Circle agent wallet on Base, and none asked the owner first.\n\nThe wallet held 10 USDC with a 0.01 USDC limit. The models pulled a one-time passcode from the owner’s email inbox and typed it in themselves.\n\nIf your agent https://t.co/iEKpUlPliZ", "url": "https://x.com/johnmorganFL/status/2116998796185944464"}, {"author_id": "1495416241070215168", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:04:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117015026816929849"], "id": "2117015026816929849", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 348, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My prediction: frontier AI won't just disrupt software jobs. It'll start disrupting software itself.\n\nKarpathy built his own YouTube recommendation engine with Claude Code in roughly 2 hours.\n\nNow imagine what Astra 6.2, Fable 5.5, and the models after them could enable.\n\nWhy", "url": "https://x.com/ZindanTech/status/2117015026816929849"}, {"author_id": "183036873", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:53:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117027316086059202"], "id": "2117027316086059202", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 17, "impression_count": 7814, "like_count": 83, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Grid down is a guarantee. Here’s why. Reduce vulnerability from counterstrike and adversaries during war. 2. We are in the AI takeoff event now. This decisive strategic advantage even if just 6mos means a compute advantage of 10,000+ years. This is worse than the nuclear era.", "url": "https://x.com/amtvmedia/status/2117027316086059202"}, {"author_id": "2074534032986222594", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:00:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117029037059268976"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/1SGFBLUsFF", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/rubbletag/status/2117029037059268976/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117029028649730048", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/1SGFBLUsFF"}]}, "id": "2117029037059268976", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 48, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Microsoft introduces Copilot harness for multi-model AI agents, making its agent orchestration technology available to developers and enterprise customers through Microsoft Foundry. Announced on October 28, the harness was developed by GitHub engineers and is already used across https://t.co/1SGFBLUsFF", "url": "https://x.com/rubbletag/status/2117029037059268976"}, {"author_id": "1524885233375809537", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:25:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117020147735282026"], "id": "2117020147735282026", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2930, "like_count": 20, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "🇪🇺 NEWS: SpaceXSI says Grok will stamp invisible watermarks on AI-generated text from November 7 to satisfy the EU AI Act", "url": "https://x.com/WorldInMotionHQ/status/2117020147735282026"}, {"author_id": "1261335549215989760", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:23:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117019769392259561"], "id": "2117019769392259561", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 301, "impression_count": 184468, "like_count": 2890, "quote_count": 64, "reply_count": 152, "retweet_count": 219}, "text": "JUST IN: SpaceXSI announces Grok will begin embedding invisible watermarks into AI-generated text starting November 7 comply with the EU AI Act.", "url": "https://x.com/Polymarket/status/2117019769392259561"}, {"author_id": "2018963047356743680", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:07:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117015668033790087"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/wVu21Kb9Yd", "end": 146, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheAionikAge/status/2117015668033790087/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117015664548306946", "start": 123, "url": "https://t.co/wVu21Kb9Yd"}]}, "id": "2117015668033790087", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Commission pages put EU AI Act enforcement from August 2026, so three months in, I've found no published enforcement case. https://t.co/wVu21Kb9Yd", "url": "https://x.com/TheAionikAge/status/2117015668033790087"}, {"author_id": "1526830850", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:42:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117024555239719254"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/POTFES/status/…", "end": 158, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/POTFES/status/2116931789088293144", "start": 135, "url": "https://t.co/s1ZAliO5rO"}]}, "id": "2117024555239719254", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 147, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116931789088293144", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Wow, this is a really good list. \n\nCongrats to Brussels. \n\nI am sure we can make an equally longer list of things we hate. \n\nEG AI Act https://t.co/s1ZAliO5rO", "url": "https://x.com/ConfusedSith/status/2117024555239719254"}, {"author_id": "2114342255334952961", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:36:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117022991179763861"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 188, "start": 183, "tag": "Grok"}, {"end": 196, "start": 189, "tag": "GrokAi"}]}, "id": "2117022991179763861", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok will begin adding invisible watermarks to AI-generated text via its API on November 7, as SpaceXSI moves to comply with the EU AI Act.\n\nAI-generated text is becoming traceable.\n\n#Grok #GrokAi", "url": "https://x.com/PithyGo/status/2117022991179763861"}, {"author_id": "2109772490470006784", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:22:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117019447785382304"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 207, "start": 197, "tag": "Anthropic"}, {"end": 211, "start": 208, "tag": "AI"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/DJNFKwLY2u", "end": 235, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/AzAutomatixdt/status/2117019447785382304/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117019432119947264", "start": 212, "url": "https://t.co/DJNFKwLY2u"}]}, "id": "2117019447785382304", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic extends Claude's invisible text watermark to 4 more models (Mythos 5, Opus 4.7/4.6, Sonnet 4.6) — but on two of them, one temperature tweak dodges the mark. EU AI Act deadline: December. #Anthropic #AI https://t.co/DJNFKwLY2u", "url": "https://x.com/AzAutomatixdt/status/2117019447785382304"}, {"author_id": "1935926558629437440", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:01:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116999072213336165"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 208, "id": "1819261", "start": 198, "username": "Anthropic"}], "urls": [{"description": "Anthropic is expanding its text watermark to four more Claude models to meet the EU AI Act's December deadline. On the older models Claude Opus 4.6 and Sonnet 4.6, developers can bypass the watermark by tweaking a single sampling parameter. Anthropic addresses the loophole with just a compliance warning.", "display_url": "the-decoder.com/anthropics-wat…", "end": 232, "expanded_url": "https://the-decoder.com/anthropics-watermark-rollout-leaves-a-loophole-on-two-older-claude-models/", "images": [{"height": 768, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116618810698670080/iUrtg97Y?format=png&name=orig", "width": 1376}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116618810698670080/iUrtg97Y?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 209, "status": 200, "title": "Anthropic's watermark rollout leaves a loophole on two older Claude models", "unwound_url": "https://the-decoder.com/anthropics-watermark-rollout-leaves-a-loophole-on-two-older-claude-models/", "url": "https://t.co/GrsARPZxGC"}]}, "id": "2116999072213336165", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 49, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic is watermarking four more Claude models for the EU's December AI Act deadline — but on Opus 4.6 and Sonnet 4.6, tweaking one sampling setting wipes the mark. Is it really compliance then? @Anthropic https://t.co/GrsARPZxGC", "url": "https://x.com/runthenumberz/status/2116999072213336165"}, {"author_id": "2106059124694007810", "created_at": "2026-1